The GDS cell layouts under cells/ are extracted from asap7_sram_0p0
(https://github.com/The-OpenROAD-Project/asap7_sram_0p0), part of the
official ASAP7 release, licensed under the BSD 3-Clause License:

    Copyright (c) 2023, The OpenROAD Project

The full license text is reproduced in that repository's LICENSE file and
applies to all vendored cell geometry.  These layouts are redistributed
here unmodified (extraction preserves geometry byte-for-byte, verified by
XOR in tests/test_golden.py).

The compact model cards under spice/models/ are converted from the ASAP7
PDK (Process Design Kit) HSPICE decks by scripts/pm2osdi.py.  The model
data is licensed under the BSD 3-Clause License:

    Copyright 2020 Lawrence T. Clark, Vinay Vashishtha, or Arizona State
    University

The full license text ships with the ASAP7 release
(https://github.com/The-OpenROAD-Project/asap7).  The conversion changes
only the framing needed by OSDI (Open Source Device Interface) and
ngspice; the parameter data is unmodified.

The design rule deck in sramforge/drc.py is an original transcription of
the published ASAP7 design rules into KLayout checks, written for this
project and calibrated so that the vendored reference layout is clean.
It is not derived from any vendor rule file.
